OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures as Tyne Bridge
OL,4,Arestoration continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoad closures have been announced as
OL,7,Frestoration of the Tyne Bridge
OL,8,Fcontinues.
OL,10,FNewcastle City Council said it had made
OL,11,F"good progress" on repairing the
OL,12,Fstructure and teams were next carrying
OL,13,Fout inspections and cleaning the twin
OL,14,Fbeams before the next section's
OL,15,Frestoration and repainting gets under
OL,16,Fway.
OL,18,FSince the project began in April 2024,
OL,19,Fmore than 2,000 individual repairs have
OL,20,Fbeen made to the bridge, ahead of its
OL,21,F100th anniversary celebrations in
OL,22,FOctober 2028.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
