OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures as Tyne Bridge
OL,4,Arestoration continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FLombard Street, Queen Street and
OL,7,FAkenside will remain shut from Monday
OL,8,Ffor four nights from 18:00 until 02:00
OL,9,FBST, while Queen Street and Akenside is
OL,10,Fto close from 07:30 to 17:00 on 14 and
OL,11,F15 September.
